# Env_Example_File: every environment variable the Template uses, with
# placeholder values only. Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
# Never commit .env; .gitignore already ignores it.
#
# Format: one KEY=value line per variable, with a comment directly above it
# that names the MCP server entry in .kiro/settings/mcp.json that uses it.
# The shipped mcp.json references no variables. When you add a server that
# uses a Secret_Reference such as ${EXAMPLE_SERVICE_TOKEN}, add it here, for
# example:
#
#   # Used by MCP server: example-service
#   EXAMPLE_SERVICE_TOKEN=replace-me
#
# scripts/validate.sh reports any Secret_Reference missing from this file.
